WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.120
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.390 --> 01:34.910
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.440 --> 01:37.860
[Episode 28]

4
01:46.780 --> 01:47.810
Comrade Zedong.

5
01:48.810 --> 01:49.740
Comrade Zedong.

6
01:50.500 --> 01:51.960
There's new information.

7
01:52.170 --> 01:54.009
At dawn today, the 9th Red Army Corps

8
01:54.009 --> 01:55.860
ambushed Wei Jinyong's unit of the Guizhou Army

9
01:55.860 --> 01:58.450
in the Laomukong area on the upper reaches of the Wujiang River.

10
01:58.450 --> 02:00.060
They originally planned to wipe out three enemy regiments,

11
02:00.060 --> 02:01.420
but five regiments came.

12
02:01.420 --> 02:02.550
They took them all on

13
02:02.890 --> 02:04.730
and captured a large quantity of weapons, equipment, and supplies.

14
02:04.730 --> 02:05.290
Great.

15
02:05.810 --> 02:07.450
With the Central Army busy heading south,

16
02:07.450 --> 02:09.250
the 9th Corps is much more at ease

17
02:09.410 --> 02:11.070
and has more room to maneuver.

18
02:12.590 --> 02:13.970
This is what they call "One move unlocks everything,

19
02:13.970 --> 02:15.570
and one success leads to another."

20
02:15.570 --> 02:16.600
That's the advantage of

21
02:16.600 --> 02:18.090
seizing the strategic initiative.

22
02:18.090 --> 02:18.740
Yes.

23
02:19.050 --> 02:19.940
Chairman Mao.

24
02:21.320 --> 02:22.130
Chairman Mao!

25
02:26.530 --> 02:27.300
Slow down.

26
02:28.620 --> 02:31.530
This is a newspaper obtained by our reconnaissance comrades

27
02:31.530 --> 02:32.770
on the outskirts of Guiyang.

28
02:32.770 --> 02:34.970
Comrade Luofu asked me to give it to you.

29
02:42.530 --> 02:43.370
Good.

30
02:44.650 --> 02:45.850
Young comrade.

31
02:46.850 --> 02:47.900
Congratulations.

32
02:47.900 --> 02:49.480
Congratulations to our newly appointed

33
02:49.480 --> 02:51.350
Secretary-General of the Central Column.

34
02:51.350 --> 02:52.590
If you have any difficulties,

35
02:52.590 --> 02:53.520
just go to Luofu.

36
02:54.350 --> 02:55.750
You two should communicate more

37
02:55.280 --> 02:57.220
[Liu Ying, Secretary-General of the Central Column]

38
02:56.530 --> 02:58.390
and strive for a win-win outcome.

39
02:59.220 --> 03:00.020
Chairman Mao.

40
03:01.820 --> 03:03.820
Well, I've given you the newspaper.

41
03:03.860 --> 03:04.980
I'll be going now.

42
03:07.060 --> 03:08.480
Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

43
03:08.480 --> 03:09.720
Look at this news.

44
03:10.500 --> 03:12.460
"The remnants of Zhu and Mao's bandits number barely 10,000.

45
03:12.460 --> 03:14.020
They suffer a thousand casualties a day.

46
03:14.020 --> 03:16.010
According to reliable intelligence,

47
03:16.010 --> 03:18.079
their leader, Zhu De, has been killed.

48
03:18.079 --> 03:21.900
The Red Bandits are even carrying his corpse with them as they march."

49
03:21.900 --> 03:23.100
With this latest report,

50
03:23.100 --> 03:24.500
that's at least ten times

51
03:24.530 --> 03:26.060
the Kuomintang newspapers

52
03:26.250 --> 03:27.650
have announced my death.

53
03:27.940 --> 03:28.730
Leaders.

54
03:29.530 --> 03:30.220
Good news.

55
03:30.390 --> 03:32.650
Sun Du's column has traveled day and night

56
03:32.650 --> 03:33.850
and has already arrived in Guiyang.

57
03:33.850 --> 03:34.530
Great.

58
03:34.560 --> 03:36.820
Drawing out the Yunnan Army is a victory.

59
03:37.100 --> 03:38.300
Are there any movements

60
03:38.300 --> 03:39.530
from other Kuomintang troops?

61
03:39.530 --> 03:40.930
Besides Sun Du's column,

62
03:41.300 --> 03:42.829
Wu Qiwei's column and the Hunan Army

63
03:42.829 --> 03:45.630
are also moving towards the area north of Guiyang.

64
03:46.460 --> 03:47.180
Good.

65
03:47.650 --> 03:48.560
With the Yunnan Army entering Guizhou,

66
03:48.560 --> 03:50.520
our passage to the west has been opened.

67
03:50.520 --> 03:51.460
Can we formulate

68
03:51.490 --> 03:52.380
the next plan?

69
03:52.710 --> 03:53.590
No rush.

70
03:54.370 --> 03:56.240
If we rush westward now,

71
03:56.530 --> 03:58.130
the rescue forces in Guiyang

72
03:58.340 --> 03:59.560
will definitely follow us closely,

73
03:59.560 --> 04:00.800
right on our heels.

74
04:01.090 --> 04:02.020
Comrade Zedong.

75
04:02.100 --> 04:03.230
What do you propose?

76
04:04.090 --> 04:05.570
Show a false front to conceal our true intentions.

77
04:05.570 --> 04:06.810
Deception is never out of place in war.

78
04:06.810 --> 04:09.210
If we draw Chiang Kai-shek's main forces

79
04:09.520 --> 04:11.250
in Guiyang to eastern Guizhou,

80
04:11.580 --> 04:12.980
we can advance westward.

81
04:14.280 --> 04:15.160
Let's go.

82
04:20.839 --> 04:22.730
[Soong Mei-ling, Wife of Chiang Kai-shek]

83
04:29.320 --> 04:30.450
How are you feeling?

84
04:30.870 --> 04:32.630
My stomach's in turmoil.

85
04:34.060 --> 04:36.210
Cixiu (Chen Cheng) just called.

86
04:37.060 --> 04:40.210
He said Sun Du's side has been settled.

87
04:40.240 --> 04:41.480
As you instructed,

88
04:41.659 --> 04:42.720
they've paid him 50,000 silver dollars.

89
04:42.720 --> 04:43.520
Water. Water.

90
04:43.880 --> 04:45.400
Good, very good.

91
04:48.720 --> 04:50.320
The Yunnan Army has arrived.

92
04:50.770 --> 04:52.860
Wu Qiwei will arrive soon.

93
04:52.940 --> 04:54.740
Guiyang should be safe.

94
04:56.130 --> 04:57.540
I was thinking,

95
04:59.180 --> 05:01.910
how about going back to Lushan to rest for a while?

96
05:04.770 --> 05:07.130
You are almost fifty years old.

97
05:07.450 --> 05:10.660
How can you stand working day and night?

98
05:11.060 --> 05:12.370
You don't know.

99
05:12.540 --> 05:14.960
Suppressing the Communists is only one part of it.

100
05:14.960 --> 05:19.520
This time, we finally settled

101
05:19.540 --> 05:22.130
the military and political issues in Guizhou.

102
05:22.130 --> 05:23.550
Sun Du's troops entering Guizhou exposed

103
05:23.550 --> 05:25.810
a weakness in Long Yun's ironclad defenses.

104
05:25.810 --> 05:28.270
If you don't strike while the iron is hot now,

105
05:28.570 --> 05:29.570
you'll never get

106
05:29.600 --> 05:31.360
another chance

107
05:34.690 --> 05:35.550
this good

108
05:35.570 --> 05:37.570
to unify the Southwest.

109
05:37.600 --> 05:38.370
-Slow down. -You understand?

110
05:38.370 --> 05:39.130
Slow down.

111
05:41.740 --> 05:43.450
Why hasn't the doctor arrived yet?

112
05:43.450 --> 05:45.380
Madam, I'll go urge him right away.

113
05:49.570 --> 05:50.330
Madam.

114
05:50.850 --> 05:51.930
Generalissimo.

115
05:53.180 --> 05:55.300
What urgent matter do you have?

116
05:55.890 --> 05:57.500
The Generalissimo is in the bathroom,

117
05:57.500 --> 05:59.980
and you won't even let him have a moment of peace.

118
05:59.980 --> 06:00.770
Cixiu.

119
06:01.080 --> 06:02.100
Is that Cixiu?

120
06:02.980 --> 06:03.770
Here!

121
06:04.480 --> 06:05.720
Speak.

122
06:05.860 --> 06:06.790
Generalissimo,

123
06:07.010 --> 06:08.800
we just received a reconnaissance report from the Air Force.

124
06:08.800 --> 06:13.200
The main force of the Communist army is crossing the Qingshui River to the east.

125
06:17.250 --> 06:19.770
The Communist forces are attacking Guiyang.

126
06:19.770 --> 06:21.450
You should see it clearly now.

127
06:22.940 --> 06:25.150
It's just a feint.

128
06:26.100 --> 06:27.760
Actually, their real purpose

129
06:28.180 --> 06:31.590
is still to flee east to western Hunan.

130
06:31.940 --> 06:32.890
Ultimately,

131
06:33.570 --> 06:36.980
they want to join forces with He Long

132
06:39.480 --> 06:42.920
and Xiao Ke's troops.

133
06:43.080 --> 06:45.200
Ge-Generalissimo,

134
06:45.320 --> 06:46.980
the Communist army is advancing east too fast.

135
06:46.980 --> 06:49.510
If we don't block them now, it will be too late.

136
06:50.360 --> 06:51.700
Listen carefully.

137
06:52.370 --> 06:55.370
Order the two columns of Wu Qiwei and Sun Du,

138
06:55.770 --> 06:57.890
and the 53rd Division of the Hunan Army,

139
06:57.890 --> 06:59.810
to immediately split into two routes

140
06:59.810 --> 07:01.180
and pursue to the east.

141
07:01.690 --> 07:04.690
All units must annihilate the Zhu-Mao Communist army

142
07:04.740 --> 07:06.210
in eastern Guizhou.

143
07:06.810 --> 07:07.590
Yes!

144
07:09.540 --> 07:11.150
Come back. Also,

145
07:14.420 --> 07:16.680
send a telegram to He Jian and Liu Jianxu,

146
07:16.720 --> 07:19.010
asking them to mobilize three divisions

147
07:19.030 --> 07:21.720
to set up strict defenses in the Shiqian and Yuqing areas.

148
07:21.720 --> 07:23.320
Then order the Guangxi Army's

149
07:23.320 --> 07:25.280
two divisions in Dushan and Duyun

150
07:25.300 --> 07:27.780
to advance to the Pingyue and Niuchang areas

151
07:27.990 --> 07:29.310
to establish a defense line.

152
07:29.310 --> 07:30.880
Did you two hear me clearly?

153
07:31.130 --> 07:32.060
Generalissimo.

154
07:32.210 --> 07:33.909
Didn't you repeatedly insist that

155
07:33.909 --> 07:36.310
the Guangxi Army must never enter Guizhou?

156
07:37.540 --> 07:40.620
Desperate times call for desperate measures.

157
07:41.620 --> 07:42.610
-Yes! -Yes!

158
07:48.890 --> 07:49.860
Cixiu.

159
07:50.370 --> 07:52.080
Cixiu, Cixiu.

160
07:52.100 --> 07:53.620
He's gone. He's gone.

161
07:53.720 --> 07:56.000
He went to execute your orders.

162
07:57.659 --> 07:59.690
My plan was to set the tiger against the wolf.

163
07:59.690 --> 08:02.290
Now it's all descended into chaos.

164
08:30.110 --> 08:32.140
On April 8, 1935,

165
08:32.640 --> 08:35.000
the 1st, 3rd, and 5th Corps of the Central Red Army

166
08:35.000 --> 08:36.900
and the Military Commission Column,

167
08:36.900 --> 08:38.539
according to the instructions of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

168
08:38.539 --> 08:39.740
split into two forces

169
08:39.809 --> 08:42.720
and advanced rapidly southwest toward Yunnan

170
08:42.880 --> 08:44.970
through a roughly 15-kilometer-wide corridor

171
08:44.970 --> 08:46.970
between Guiyang and Longli,

172
08:46.970 --> 08:49.830
covering about 60 kilometers a day.

173
08:50.570 --> 08:52.210
They left hundreds of thousands of Kuomintang troops

174
08:52.210 --> 08:54.390
stranded in the mountainous areas of eastern Guizhou,

175
08:54.390 --> 08:56.430
once again foiling Chiang Kai-shek's

176
08:56.430 --> 08:59.190
carefully laid plan to

177
08:59.210 --> 09:00.940
annihilate the Red Army there.

178
09:02.970 --> 09:04.330
Chiang Kai-shek's direct confrontation

179
09:04.330 --> 09:06.420
with Mao Zedong on the battlefield

180
09:06.990 --> 09:08.590
failed once again.

181
09:18.070 --> 09:19.660
They are all waiting.

182
09:20.690 --> 09:22.310
Can you come out and talk?

183
09:22.730 --> 09:24.730
You've been in there for a long time.

184
09:25.490 --> 09:27.490
Our troops are sluggish and clumsy.

185
09:27.710 --> 09:29.570
Being played and deceived by them

186
09:29.730 --> 09:33.210
is the greatest shame of my military career.

187
09:33.970 --> 09:35.090
We must analyze,

188
09:35.540 --> 09:36.830
summarize,

189
09:36.850 --> 09:38.080
and learn from this.

190
09:38.650 --> 09:40.220
We must reorganize the army

191
09:40.330 --> 09:41.790
and continue the pursuit!

192
09:42.260 --> 09:43.320
As the saying goes,

193
09:43.690 --> 09:45.550
knowing shame is akin to courage!

194
09:46.450 --> 09:47.850
I don't believe

195
09:49.450 --> 09:51.100
they can escape to the sky.

196
10:10.300 --> 10:11.690
While the Central Red Army

197
10:11.690 --> 10:13.330
maneuvered across Guizhou to evade

198
10:13.330 --> 10:15.860
hundreds of thousands of Kuomintang troops,

199
10:16.140 --> 10:18.810
the 4th Front Army, having just weathered

200
10:18.810 --> 10:20.610
the KMT's Six-Route Encirclement Campaign,

201
10:20.610 --> 10:23.780
acted on the decisions of the Wangcangba Conference in early February.

202
10:23.780 --> 10:25.850
It pulled back its forces on the eastern front

203
10:25.850 --> 10:28.110
and concentrated its main strength to cross the Jialing River westward

204
10:28.110 --> 10:30.040
in support of the Central Red Army.

205
10:30.780 --> 10:32.330
After nearly two months of

206
10:32.330 --> 10:33.780
campaign preparation,

207
10:34.410 --> 10:36.120
the main force of the 4th Front Army

208
10:36.120 --> 10:38.740
all gathered on the east bank of the Jialing River,

209
10:38.360 --> 10:41.760
[Sichuan, East Bank of the Jialing River]

210
10:39.450 --> 10:41.980
and the river-crossing battle was imminent.

211
11:11.820 --> 11:12.480
Where is he?

212
11:13.320 --> 11:14.980
He must have been washed away by the river.

213
11:14.980 --> 11:16.780
[Liu Xicai, Squad Leader, the 4th Front Army]

214
11:16.090 --> 11:16.850
Liu Xiaohuo.

215
11:17.120 --> 11:18.320
Don't talk nonsense.

216
11:31.540 --> 11:32.690
Isn't that Zhang Side?

217
11:32.690 --> 11:33.380
It's him.

218
11:33.870 --> 11:35.130
I told you he'd be fine.

219
11:41.480 --> 11:43.770
[Zhang Side, Soldier, the 4th Front Army]

220
12:26.990 --> 12:27.560
Who is it?

221
12:43.140 --> 12:44.270
You little bastard!

222
12:44.280 --> 12:45.440
You want to kill me?

223
12:45.590 --> 12:46.990
I'm taking a shit.

224
12:47.480 --> 12:48.240
Stand up.

225
12:49.110 --> 12:49.720
Go.

226
13:31.100 --> 13:31.650
Hurry.

227
13:31.850 --> 13:32.520
Follow me.

228
14:08.040 --> 14:09.470
Hurry, follow me!

229
15:11.670 --> 15:12.240
Zhang Side!

230
15:12.240 --> 15:13.570
Zhang Side. Zhang Side!

231
15:13.690 --> 15:14.350
Zhang Side.

232
15:15.210 --> 15:15.870
Zhang Side.

233
15:18.730 --> 15:19.460
Hold steady.

234
15:21.710 --> 15:22.510
Pull him over.

235
15:24.410 --> 15:26.020
I'm here. I'm here.

236
15:26.050 --> 15:27.180
Company Commander.

237
15:28.390 --> 15:29.650
You promised me before

238
15:30.660 --> 15:31.720
that if I got a boat,

239
15:31.970 --> 15:34.370
you'd let our Squad join the commando team.

240
15:34.380 --> 15:35.180
Does it count?

241
15:35.540 --> 15:36.420
I keep my word.

242
15:36.610 --> 15:37.870
It definitely counts.

243
15:37.960 --> 15:39.600
The Company Commander always keeps his word.

244
15:39.600 --> 15:41.150
Come on. Come on.

245
15:43.630 --> 15:44.090
Come on.

246
15:45.720 --> 15:46.690
How did I do?

247
15:48.540 --> 15:49.450
You did great.

248
15:49.890 --> 15:50.640
You

249
15:51.090 --> 15:53.210
made a great contribution to our Squad again.

250
15:53.210 --> 15:55.190
Consider yourself verbally commended.

251
15:55.190 --> 15:55.650
Come on.

252
15:56.190 --> 15:56.650
Come on.

253
15:58.070 --> 15:58.670
Slow down.

254
16:00.380 --> 16:01.410
I can walk by myself.

255
16:01.410 --> 16:02.610
I'd better carry you.

256
16:03.210 --> 16:04.300
You need to rest.

257
16:04.600 --> 16:06.850
We're counting on you to lead the charge

258
16:06.870 --> 16:08.860
when our squad goes on the assault.

259
16:13.020 --> 16:16.770
[The 4th Front Army Headquarters, Jialing River Bank, Sichuan]

260
16:13.200 --> 16:14.130
Chairman Zhang.

261
16:14.900 --> 16:15.900
The meal's ready.

262
16:17.780 --> 16:18.750
We didn't prepare much.

263
16:18.750 --> 16:20.010
Please make do with it.

264
16:20.690 --> 16:21.910
What's there to prepare?

265
16:21.910 --> 16:23.420
I'll eat whatever you eat.

266
16:24.540 --> 16:25.550
He went to the front line.

267
16:25.550 --> 16:26.350
Wait a minute.

268
16:26.390 --> 16:27.610
Don't put the dishes there.

269
16:27.610 --> 16:29.100
Put the map away. Hurry.

270
16:29.130 --> 16:29.820
Guard.

271
16:30.570 --> 16:31.450
Come.

272
16:39.650 --> 16:40.940
Come and sit, Chairman Zhang.

273
16:40.940 --> 16:41.820
Have a quick bite.

274
16:41.820 --> 16:44.350
We'll eat together when Xiangqian gets back.

275
16:45.030 --> 16:45.760
Give it to me.

276
16:49.020 --> 16:49.950
Chairman Zhang.

277
16:51.040 --> 16:51.800
I'm back.

278
16:52.730 --> 16:53.430
Xiangqian.

279
16:54.210 --> 16:55.540
I have to criticize you.

280
16:56.970 --> 16:58.430
Did you go to the front line

281
16:58.540 --> 16:59.780
to scout alone again?

282
17:00.050 --> 17:01.180
It's too dangerous.

283
17:02.140 --> 17:05.579
What if the Sichuan Army snipes at you?

284
17:06.619 --> 17:08.290
Know yourself and know your enemy, and you will never be defeated.

285
17:08.290 --> 17:08.819
Besides,

286
17:09.050 --> 17:09.920
the river is so wide,

287
17:09.920 --> 17:11.000
the enemy's bullets can't reach me.

288
17:10.910 --> 17:13.710
[Zhang Guotao, Member of the CPC Politburo Standing Committee and Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission]

289
17:11.119 --> 17:12.720
You can't leave it to chance.

290
17:13.160 --> 17:14.160
Don't do it again.

291
17:14.859 --> 17:15.450
Okay.

292
17:15.760 --> 17:16.359
Let's eat.

293
17:16.450 --> 17:17.410
Okay. Sit.

294
17:24.020 --> 17:26.290
[Chen Changhao, Political Commissar of the 4th Front Army]

295
17:24.420 --> 17:25.079
Xiangqian.

296
17:25.660 --> 17:26.720
Talk while you eat.

297
17:26.770 --> 17:28.180
Hurry up and report the specific deployment of the battle

298
17:28.180 --> 17:29.070
to Chairman Zhang.

299
17:29.070 --> 17:29.660
Okay.

300
17:33.660 --> 17:34.590
Chairman Zhang.

301
17:34.960 --> 17:37.250
We plan to set up three river crossing points:

302
17:37.250 --> 17:38.180
Yuanxikou,

303
17:38.490 --> 17:39.140
Tazishan,

304
17:39.340 --> 17:40.200
and Jianxikou.

305
17:40.200 --> 17:41.690
These three points are all located

306
17:41.690 --> 17:43.250
between Cangxi and Langzhong.

307
17:43.250 --> 17:44.580
This area is defended by

308
17:44.900 --> 17:47.120
the 29th Army under Tian Songyao of the Sichuan Army.

309
17:47.120 --> 17:49.090
Tian Songyao is our old rival,

310
17:49.210 --> 17:51.010
but he has never won against us.

311
17:52.770 --> 17:54.010
Among these three points,

312
17:54.010 --> 17:56.050
Tazishan is an important breakthrough point.

313
17:56.050 --> 17:57.820
The river is wide and the current is gentle here,

314
17:57.820 --> 17:59.010
but the enemy holds the high ground on the opposite bank.

315
17:59.010 --> 18:01.240
I'll position artillery in advance to support our crossing.

316
18:01.240 --> 18:04.040
[Huang Chao, Secretary-General of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission and the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Soviet Government]

317
18:01.580 --> 18:03.210
The specific troop arrangement is as follows:

318
18:03.210 --> 18:05.690
With the Fourth Red Army as the headquarters reserve,

319
18:05.690 --> 18:07.940
the 31st Army, the 30th Army, and the 9th Army

320
18:07.940 --> 18:10.250
will launch fierce attacks at the three points simultaneously.

321
18:10.250 --> 18:11.180
After crossing the river,

322
18:11.180 --> 18:12.770
the 9th Army will split some of its troops

323
18:12.770 --> 18:13.900
to head to the southern region

324
18:13.900 --> 18:15.220
to block the Sichuan Army's reinforcements.

325
18:15.220 --> 18:17.290
The rest of the troops will advance rapidly to the north

326
18:17.290 --> 18:18.180
to seize Jianmen Pass.

327
18:18.180 --> 18:19.860
Jianmen Pass is the gateway between Sichuan and Shaanxi...

328
18:19.860 --> 18:20.660
Alright.

329
18:21.210 --> 18:21.870
Xiangqian.

330
18:22.100 --> 18:24.290
As long as you are confident in your deployment,

331
18:24.290 --> 18:25.100
I'm relieved.

332
18:25.450 --> 18:26.420
Come, let's eat.

333
18:26.420 --> 18:27.100
Come.

334
18:29.390 --> 18:31.050
He has plenty of ways to fight.

335
18:38.210 --> 18:38.870
Xiangqian.

336
18:41.140 --> 18:43.860
What do you think about our development

337
18:43.860 --> 18:45.790
after crossing the Jialing River?

338
18:52.530 --> 18:53.460
Chairman Zhang.

339
18:53.770 --> 18:54.970
At the Qingjiangdu Conference,

340
18:54.970 --> 18:57.460
we formulated the Sichuan-Shaanxi-Gansu plan.

341
18:57.460 --> 18:59.100
I think after we cross the river,

342
18:59.100 --> 19:00.290
we should continue to implement it,

343
19:00.290 --> 19:02.180
relying on the old Soviet area, shrinking the front line,

344
19:02.180 --> 19:05.070
and waiting for an opportunity to develop a new Soviet area in southern Gansu.

345
19:05.070 --> 19:06.510
The old Soviet area,

346
19:08.240 --> 19:10.010
do you think it's still worth holding on to?

347
19:10.010 --> 19:10.730
Of course.

348
19:11.040 --> 19:12.280
If we can carry out our

349
19:12.490 --> 19:14.100
strategic plan successfully,

350
19:14.100 --> 19:16.050
the old Soviet base can not only survive,

351
19:16.050 --> 19:17.580
but also grow stronger

352
19:17.730 --> 19:19.060
and play a greater role.

353
19:19.530 --> 19:22.420
It's Hu Zongnan's troops stationed in southern Gansu.

354
19:22.420 --> 19:23.250
Don't forget,

355
19:24.450 --> 19:27.510
he's one of Chiang Kai-shek's most trusted loyalists.

356
19:33.220 --> 19:34.510
So you mean

357
19:35.070 --> 19:37.870
we should completely abandon the old Soviet area?

358
19:42.090 --> 19:44.330
Now is not the time to discuss this.

359
19:48.000 --> 19:49.190
This dish is too spicy.

360
19:49.190 --> 19:51.670
[Wang Shusheng, Deputy Commander of the 4th Front Army]

361
19:49.230 --> 19:49.940
Shusheng,

362
19:50.150 --> 19:52.240
why are there so many peppers in this dish?

363
19:52.240 --> 19:53.030
Get it adjusted right away.

364
19:53.030 --> 19:54.030
My mistake.

365
19:55.660 --> 19:57.720
It's already cooked. Don't waste it.

366
20:00.820 --> 20:01.750
Save some for me.

367
20:05.140 --> 20:06.530
This isn't eating spicy food.

368
20:06.530 --> 20:08.050
It's like eating fire.

369
20:15.080 --> 20:16.760
Alright, I'm done eating.

370
20:17.620 --> 20:18.810
Then I'll wait for your

371
20:18.810 --> 20:21.410
good news of successfully crossing the river.

372
20:33.510 --> 20:34.510
Clear it away.

373
20:39.090 --> 20:40.890
Hope everything goes smoothly.

374
20:41.490 --> 20:42.490
Let's eat.

375
20:43.630 --> 20:45.160
Political Commissar Chen.

376
20:46.380 --> 20:47.660
I'm going to the 9th Army.

377
20:47.660 --> 20:49.120
They have a severe shortage of river-crossing supplies.

378
20:49.120 --> 20:50.450
Shusheng, come with me.

379
20:51.140 --> 20:52.130
Keep in touch via radio.

380
20:52.130 --> 20:52.890
Okay.

381
21:45.730 --> 21:48.350
On the night of March 28, 1935,

382
21:48.520 --> 21:50.530
the main force of the the 4th Front Army

383
21:50.530 --> 21:52.890
fully broke through the Jialing River defense

384
21:52.890 --> 21:55.050
and quickly advanced to Jianmen Pass.

385
21:55.190 --> 21:57.590
After capturing Jianmen Pass on April 2,

386
21:57.900 --> 22:00.820
Xu Xiangqian commanded the troops to advance,

387
22:00.850 --> 22:03.660
capturing the county town of Beichuan on the 21st.

388
22:04.210 --> 22:04.810
With this,

389
22:05.180 --> 22:06.820
the 24-day

390
22:06.820 --> 22:09.150
Jialing River Campaign ended in victory.

391
22:09.530 --> 22:13.050
The campaign annihilated 12 Regiments, totaling over 10,000 enemies,

392
22:13.050 --> 22:14.760
and captured eight county towns.

393
22:14.760 --> 22:16.690
It controlled a vast area stretching from the Jialing River in the east

394
22:16.690 --> 22:19.250
to Beichuan in the west, and from Zitong in the south

395
22:19.250 --> 22:21.970
to the Sichuan-Gansu border in the north.

396
22:22.100 --> 22:24.770
The Jialing River Campaign launched by the 4th Front Army

397
22:24.770 --> 22:26.340
pinned down the Sichuan army,

398
22:26.340 --> 22:28.930
strategically supporting the Central Red Army's operations

399
22:28.930 --> 22:31.260
in the Sichuan-Yunnan-Guizhou border region.

400
22:31.140 --> 22:34.910
[Guiyang, Guizhou]

401
22:31.330 --> 22:32.530
Today,

402
22:33.220 --> 22:34.570
we are in Guiyang

403
22:35.070 --> 22:38.660
holding the third Premier Memorial Week.

404
22:39.980 --> 22:42.540
I have a few words to say.

405
22:43.250 --> 22:46.450
The Central Army entered Guizhou to suppress the Communists.

406
22:46.450 --> 22:50.110
Although there are still remnants of the Zhu-Mao Communist army,

407
22:51.050 --> 22:52.420
this action

408
22:52.860 --> 22:55.060
has gained the support and endorsement

409
22:55.250 --> 22:57.290
of the vast majority of the people in Guizhou.

410
22:57.290 --> 22:58.250
Therefore,

411
22:58.450 --> 22:59.730
the Zhu-Mao Communist army

412
22:59.730 --> 23:02.580
has reached a dead end.

413
23:03.210 --> 23:05.210
As long as we pursue them in victory,

414
23:05.530 --> 23:08.450
we can not only eliminate them,

415
23:08.970 --> 23:10.690
but also complete all

416
23:11.210 --> 23:14.580
the unfinished great cause of the National Revolution!

417
23:30.300 --> 23:31.780
Taking this opportunity,

418
23:32.090 --> 23:33.970
there is another important matter

419
23:33.970 --> 23:35.360
I want to talk about.

420
23:35.970 --> 23:37.700
According to Xue Yue's report,

421
23:37.700 --> 23:38.690
the main force of the Zhu-Mao Communist army

422
23:38.690 --> 23:40.620
crossed the Beipan River westward

423
23:40.920 --> 23:41.960
on April 18,

424
23:42.020 --> 23:43.350
then captured Xingren.

425
23:43.890 --> 23:45.860
They've now advanced close to the Yunnan-Guizhou border.

426
23:45.860 --> 23:47.420
How should we start?

427
23:48.100 --> 23:49.050
I think

428
23:49.250 --> 23:52.680
we should start with the first thing everyone does

429
23:53.010 --> 23:55.690
when they wake up in the morning.

430
23:56.450 --> 23:57.390
That is,

431
23:58.660 --> 24:00.260
washing your face with clean

432
24:00.590 --> 24:01.590
and cold water,

433
24:02.180 --> 24:03.310
to refresh your mind

434
24:03.730 --> 24:05.330
and invigorate your spirit.

435
24:05.530 --> 24:07.580
According to the Generalissimo,

436
24:07.810 --> 24:11.150
can brushing teeth and washing face with clean water every day

437
24:11.150 --> 24:12.910
save the country?

438
24:12.970 --> 24:16.820
We must reflect the new face of our nation.

439
24:17.810 --> 24:19.160
I once met

440
24:19.670 --> 24:21.670
a ten-year-old child on the road.

441
24:22.290 --> 24:24.250
This child was smoking.

442
24:25.010 --> 24:26.010
Ten years old!

443
24:26.330 --> 24:28.330
A child who is only ten years old!

444
24:29.290 --> 24:30.940
I called his parents over

445
24:31.660 --> 24:33.940
and reprimanded them without hesitation.

446
24:33.940 --> 24:35.510
But this is not enough.

447
24:36.210 --> 24:38.870
I also called his grandfather and grandmother,

448
24:39.060 --> 24:40.860
and reprimanded them together.

449
24:41.530 --> 24:42.920
Think about it, everyone.

450
24:42.920 --> 24:44.680
Starting to smoke at such a young age,

451
24:44.680 --> 24:46.660
what kind of future will he have when he grows up?

452
24:46.660 --> 24:48.320
Can he ever serve this country

453
24:48.340 --> 24:50.420
with a clear conscience?

454
24:51.290 --> 24:53.290
If everyone has such bad habits,

455
24:53.730 --> 24:54.770
our nation

456
24:54.910 --> 24:55.990
and our country

457
24:56.660 --> 24:57.850
have no hope.

458
24:58.970 --> 25:00.440
Then we won't be able

459
25:01.730 --> 25:03.540
to see a future for China either.

460
25:04.940 --> 25:05.900
Gentlemen,

461
25:06.200 --> 25:08.550
join the New Life Movement.

462
25:09.050 --> 25:11.100
Let us, like suppressing the Communists,

463
25:11.100 --> 25:13.710
"act vigorously, quickly, and firmly" ,

464
25:14.330 --> 25:17.190
and the revolutionary cause will surely succeed.

465
25:29.820 --> 25:30.480
That's all.

466
25:51.960 --> 25:54.200
This is a typical diversionary tactic.

467
25:55.140 --> 25:56.660
No wonder some time ago,

468
25:56.970 --> 25:58.700
Mao Zedong was running rampant

469
25:58.970 --> 26:00.380
across southern Guizhou,

470
26:00.380 --> 26:01.890
causing trouble everywhere.

471
26:01.890 --> 26:04.350
His real aim was to draw Sun Du's forces out

472
26:04.450 --> 26:06.450
and send them scrambling westward.

473
26:07.180 --> 26:09.380
The fact that Zhu-Mao Communist have moved west

474
26:09.380 --> 26:11.000
into Yunnan may not be such a bad thing for your grand plan

475
26:11.000 --> 26:12.860
to pacify the Southwest, after all.

476
26:12.860 --> 26:13.930
Zurong (Yan Daogang),

477
26:13.930 --> 26:14.930
draft a telegram.

478
26:15.450 --> 26:17.580
Order the pursuing troops not to stop.

479
26:18.250 --> 26:20.190
Continue advancing west along the Yunnan-Guizhou line

480
26:20.190 --> 26:21.570
to prevent the Communist army from moving north.

481
26:21.570 --> 26:24.560
Also, prevent them from making a feint

482
26:24.580 --> 26:25.580
and doubling back into Guizhou.

483
26:25.580 --> 26:26.160
Yes.

484
26:26.610 --> 26:27.540
Generalissimo.

485
26:28.660 --> 26:30.380
Boling's telegram the day before yesterday also mentioned

486
26:30.380 --> 26:32.940
that the units of our Pursuit Army have been marching for days

487
26:32.940 --> 26:36.070
along the mountain roads on the Yunnan-Guizhou border.

488
26:36.690 --> 26:38.130
They are already exhausted,

489
26:38.130 --> 26:39.770
have suffered many losses, and have complaints.

490
26:39.770 --> 26:40.620
Complaints?

491
26:40.970 --> 26:42.690
What complaints? Tell me.

492
26:43.450 --> 26:44.100
Yes.

493
26:44.230 --> 26:44.950
They say,

494
26:44.970 --> 26:46.030
"The Communist army takes a stroll

495
26:46.030 --> 26:47.690
while we run ourselves ragged.

496
26:47.690 --> 26:48.660
We chase them everywhere,

497
26:48.660 --> 26:49.950
bleeding and sweating.

498
26:49.950 --> 26:50.950
If we don't fight,

499
26:50.950 --> 26:52.210
we might as well go home

500
26:52.510 --> 26:53.940
and pound garlic for a living."

501
26:53.940 --> 26:54.940
Nonsense!

502
26:56.820 --> 26:58.100
Add a line to the telegram:

503
26:58.100 --> 27:01.230
Tell Xue Boling to restore military discipline at once.

504
27:01.250 --> 27:02.650
Revolutionary comrades

505
27:03.250 --> 27:04.820
must fight hypocrisy with action,

506
27:04.820 --> 27:06.270
laziness with diligence,

507
27:06.270 --> 27:08.490
and cowardice with resolve.

508
27:09.340 --> 27:10.250
Those who demoralize the troops

509
27:10.250 --> 27:11.380
will be punished by military law!

510
27:11.380 --> 27:12.040
Yes.

511
27:15.420 --> 27:22.430
[Kunming, Yunnan]

512
27:24.810 --> 27:26.720
Look at Xue Yue's marching route.

513
27:28.250 --> 27:29.160
It's obvious

514
27:30.100 --> 27:32.460
he's driving the Communist army towards Yunnan.

515
27:32.460 --> 27:35.460
[Lu Han, Director of Yunnan Provincial Committee of the Kuomintang]

516
27:33.530 --> 27:35.730
Chiang wants to use the same trick he used on Guizhou

517
27:35.730 --> 27:37.060
to deal with our Yunnan.

518
27:37.420 --> 27:39.620
He's borrowing a passage to conquer us.

519
27:40.450 --> 27:43.020
But Sun Du's column is still in Qianxi.

520
27:43.050 --> 27:44.810
Our defense in Yunnan is empty.

521
27:43.130 --> 27:45.230
[Long Yun, Commander-in-Chief of the Kuomintang's 2nd Route Pursuit Army and Chairman of Yunnan Provincial Government]

522
27:45.290 --> 27:46.940
How should we respond?

523
27:48.450 --> 27:51.050
I have ordered Li Song's independent regiment

524
27:51.080 --> 27:54.250
to rush to the Yangchangying area overnight to intercept the Communist army.

525
27:54.250 --> 27:56.050
Even if the interception fails,

526
27:56.490 --> 27:58.620
it can buy some time for Sun Du.

527
27:59.140 --> 27:59.900
Besides,

528
28:00.210 --> 28:01.490
we can only hope

529
28:01.490 --> 28:03.900
that the exhausted Zhu-Mao Communist army

530
28:03.970 --> 28:07.970
will be dragged to death in the mountains on the Yunnan-Guizhou border.

531
28:11.280 --> 28:14.640
[Yunnan Region]

532
28:13.600 --> 28:14.640
On the 24th,

533
28:15.530 --> 28:18.250
the 2nd Regiment of the 1st Red Division defeated Li Song's

534
28:18.250 --> 28:20.730
Independent Regiment of the Yunnan Army in the Bailong Mountain area,

535
28:20.730 --> 28:22.460
opening the passage to Yunnan.

536
28:22.940 --> 28:25.140
The main force followed immediately

537
28:25.620 --> 28:26.950
and all entered Yunnan.

538
28:27.140 --> 28:27.970
There is no longer

539
28:27.970 --> 28:30.230
any military resistance here in Yunnan.

540
28:30.340 --> 28:32.670
The biggest difficulty for all troops now

541
28:32.940 --> 28:33.940
is marching.

542
28:34.450 --> 28:35.250
I know.

543
28:36.610 --> 28:37.540
Right now,

544
28:38.340 --> 28:39.940
only by marching on foot

545
28:40.430 --> 28:42.690
can we regain the strategic initiative.

546
28:44.320 --> 28:44.950
Comrade!

547
28:45.280 --> 28:46.190
Medic!

548
28:46.940 --> 28:47.690
Hurry!

549
28:48.180 --> 28:49.040
Hurry! Coming!

550
28:49.860 --> 28:50.420
Medic!

551
28:50.970 --> 28:51.900
Coming! Coming!

552
28:54.690 --> 28:55.690
Comrade Zedong.

553
28:56.690 --> 28:58.940
Help me call Comrade Zedong.

554
28:59.630 --> 29:00.760
Here, wait a moment.

555
29:03.530 --> 29:04.620
Comrade Zedong.

556
29:04.710 --> 29:06.870
You want to gain the strategic initiative.

557
29:06.870 --> 29:08.490
I, Wang Jiaxiang,

558
29:08.520 --> 29:10.380
completely agree with your idea.

559
29:11.530 --> 29:12.450
But

560
29:12.720 --> 29:14.110
I also ask you

561
29:14.250 --> 29:16.160
to consider the problem

562
29:16.770 --> 29:18.300
from our actual situation.

563
29:18.420 --> 29:20.050
Our actual situation is

564
29:20.450 --> 29:22.250
that we can't even find the way.

565
29:22.500 --> 29:24.850
Our soldiers are too exhausted

566
29:25.560 --> 29:27.020
and urgently need to rest.

567
29:27.660 --> 29:28.620
Think about it.

568
29:28.650 --> 29:31.580
If our Military Commission Column is in this state,

569
29:31.820 --> 29:32.970
the other Corps

570
29:33.360 --> 29:35.400
must be even worse off.

571
29:36.040 --> 29:37.040
Comrade Luofu

572
29:37.380 --> 29:39.440
has been marching with the 3rd Corps.

573
29:39.530 --> 29:42.810
He said the comrades have a lot of complaints,

574
29:43.530 --> 29:46.420
saying they are going in circles every day,

575
29:46.620 --> 29:48.180
always going in circles,

576
29:48.380 --> 29:49.420
getting nowhere

577
29:49.540 --> 29:50.900
and never fighting the enemy.

578
29:50.900 --> 29:52.770
What kind of tactic is this?

579
29:53.040 --> 29:54.440
If we don't go in circles,

580
29:54.770 --> 29:56.430
how can we mobilize the enemy?

581
29:57.300 --> 29:58.700
If we don't go in circles,

582
29:59.420 --> 30:01.390
how can we create combat opportunities?

583
30:01.390 --> 30:02.990
We just have to go in circles.

584
30:03.080 --> 30:04.620
If our strength is exhausted,

585
30:04.620 --> 30:05.530
a good sleep

586
30:05.960 --> 30:07.340
can bring us back to life.

587
30:07.340 --> 30:09.070
But if we are caught by the enemy

588
30:09.210 --> 30:09.940
and blocked,

589
30:10.470 --> 30:11.600
once we fall asleep,

590
30:12.620 --> 30:14.150
we will never wake up again.

591
30:14.250 --> 30:15.450
Bocheng often says,

592
30:15.900 --> 30:18.940
"When the brave meet on a desperate path, the bold win. "

593
30:18.940 --> 30:20.180
We are now

594
30:20.500 --> 30:23.370
walking on a narrow path, and the persistent wins.

595
30:24.080 --> 30:25.540
We are tired from walking,

596
30:25.890 --> 30:28.260
and the Kuomintang army is also tired.

597
30:29.880 --> 30:32.010
It depends on who can hold on to the end.

598
30:41.880 --> 30:43.340
I just lit this cigarette.

599
30:44.240 --> 30:45.560
Have a few puffs.

600
30:46.690 --> 30:47.690
I lost the battle.

601
30:48.050 --> 30:50.310
I don't deserve to smoke your cigarette.

602
30:50.800 --> 30:52.190
I should thank you

603
30:52.580 --> 30:55.820
for helping me test the combat strength of the Communist army.

604
30:55.820 --> 30:57.140
Your Independent Regiment

605
30:57.140 --> 30:58.860
is fully equipped with French gear,

606
30:58.860 --> 31:00.730
making it one of the best-equipped units

607
31:00.730 --> 31:02.050
in the Yunnan Army.

608
31:02.450 --> 31:03.780
But what was the result?

609
31:04.620 --> 31:06.340
On our own turf,

610
31:06.580 --> 31:08.220
one regiment of exhausted Communist army

611
31:08.220 --> 31:10.490
chased your men for seventy li

612
31:10.510 --> 31:11.970
after a single encounter.

613
31:12.210 --> 31:14.770
After two hours of fighting,

614
31:15.280 --> 31:16.550
only you, the Regiment Commander,

615
31:16.550 --> 31:18.480
came back with a few guards.

616
31:18.730 --> 31:20.340
I don't even dare to think about it.

617
31:20.340 --> 31:22.760
Just the thought of it sends shivers down my spine.

618
31:22.760 --> 31:23.760
I am incompetent.

619
31:23.940 --> 31:25.820
I am willing to face military justice.

620
31:25.820 --> 31:27.620
I don't want to see you right now.

621
31:28.820 --> 31:29.470
Go.

622
31:34.820 --> 31:37.080
Thank you for your mercy, Chairman Long.

623
31:39.110 --> 31:39.780
Cousin.

624
31:40.580 --> 31:42.910
It seems we can't stop the Communist army.

625
31:49.030 --> 31:50.350
My assessment is that

626
31:50.620 --> 31:53.770
the Communist army is unlikely to remain in Yunnan for long.

627
31:53.770 --> 31:54.900
Their ultimate goal

628
31:55.050 --> 31:56.910
is still to cross the Jinsha River

629
31:56.970 --> 31:58.420
and head north into Sichuan.

630
31:58.420 --> 32:00.550
Wherever Zhu-Mao Communist advance,

631
32:01.050 --> 32:03.580
Generalissimo Chiang's troops will follow.

632
32:03.820 --> 32:04.420
Exactly.

633
32:04.660 --> 32:07.010
As long as the Communist army leaves Yunnan as soon as possible,

634
32:07.010 --> 32:09.470
the Central Army will have no reason to stay.

635
32:09.900 --> 32:10.750
Report!

636
32:11.380 --> 32:11.960
Come in.

637
32:13.490 --> 32:16.020
Urgent telegram from Generalissimo Chiang.

638
32:18.810 --> 32:19.400
Yes.

639
32:23.900 --> 32:25.830
Generalissimo Chiang's judgment

640
32:26.970 --> 32:29.420
happens to coincide with ours.

641
32:29.900 --> 32:30.690
How so?

642
32:31.050 --> 32:31.980
He also believes

643
32:32.180 --> 32:33.450
that the Zhu-Mao Communist army will advance north

644
32:33.450 --> 32:34.770
from Pingyi (now Fuyuan, Yunnan),

645
32:34.770 --> 32:36.520
to join Luo Binghui's Communist army

646
32:36.520 --> 32:38.180
operating around Shuicheng,

647
32:38.450 --> 32:40.650
then cross the Jinsha River to the west,

648
32:40.970 --> 32:43.730
or enter southern Sichuan directly from Bijie.

649
32:44.220 --> 32:45.050
So he ordered

650
32:45.250 --> 32:48.100
all units of the Pursuit Army to go all out

651
32:48.450 --> 32:49.970
to annihilate the Communist army

652
32:49.970 --> 32:51.970
in the area from Xuanwei to Weining.

653
32:51.970 --> 32:53.430
If that's really the case,

654
32:54.160 --> 32:55.720
then we don't need to worry.

655
32:56.340 --> 32:58.210
It's best if we can annihilate the Communist army.

656
32:58.210 --> 32:59.340
Even if we fail,

657
32:59.580 --> 33:01.620
once the Communist army crosses north into Sichuan,

658
33:01.620 --> 33:02.960
the one who should worry then

659
33:02.960 --> 33:04.500
will be Liu Xiang.

660
33:07.660 --> 33:09.460
Reply to Generalissimo Chiang.

661
33:09.860 --> 33:13.530
All units in Yunnan will strictly follow the Generalissimo's orders.

662
33:13.530 --> 33:14.190
Yes.

663
33:29.870 --> 33:34.820
[Cadre Rest and Recuperation Company, Xingyi, Guizhou]

664
33:34.960 --> 33:36.420
Everyone is so exhausted.

665
33:36.820 --> 33:38.280
I wonder what Runzhi and the others

666
33:38.280 --> 33:39.430
are planning.

667
33:40.140 --> 33:40.900
Don't worry.

668
33:41.250 --> 33:42.620
Runzhi will take this situation

669
33:42.620 --> 33:44.270
into consideration.

670
33:44.900 --> 33:47.010
He never acts blindly.

671
33:47.870 --> 33:49.510
We don't need to worry.

672
33:50.010 --> 33:51.210
Just put in the effort

673
33:51.210 --> 33:52.050
and follow along.

674
33:52.050 --> 33:53.690
Yes, just follow along.

675
33:53.910 --> 33:55.070
Mr. Dong, give me the stuff.

676
33:55.070 --> 33:56.130
No, Comrade Li Zhi.

677
33:56.450 --> 33:57.050
You should

678
33:57.290 --> 33:59.140
go help the female comrades behind.

679
33:59.140 --> 34:00.180
We old comrades

680
34:00.420 --> 34:01.770
can just help each other.

681
34:01.770 --> 34:03.210
It's okay, I'll just lend a hand. Come on.

682
34:03.210 --> 34:03.690
No need.

683
34:03.720 --> 34:04.580
Those female comrades

684
34:04.580 --> 34:05.680
are usually very active,

685
34:05.680 --> 34:07.460
[Lin Boqu, Director of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission's Confiscation and Requisition Committee]

686
34:05.820 --> 34:07.290
but now there's not even a sound from them.

687
34:07.290 --> 34:07.970
Go help them quickly.

688
34:07.970 --> 34:08.780
Yes, go ahead.

689
34:08.820 --> 34:09.610
Be careful.

690
34:21.830 --> 34:22.270
Come.

691
34:22.630 --> 34:23.980
Give it to me. Come.

692
34:24.889 --> 34:25.710
Be careful.

693
34:33.429 --> 34:35.080
[Deng Yingchao, Committee Member of the Party General Branch of the Cadre Rest-and-Rehabilitation Company]

694
34:49.360 --> 34:51.360
Let's find a place ahead to rest.

695
34:52.699 --> 34:54.010
[He Zizhen, wife of Mao Zedong]

696
34:53.080 --> 34:54.340
Let's rest a bit ahead.

697
35:14.210 --> 35:15.470
Have some water first.

698
35:18.660 --> 35:19.620
Comrades,

699
35:20.130 --> 35:21.970
listen to me.

700
35:22.290 --> 35:25.330
Now's the time to rest and relax.

701
35:25.610 --> 35:27.610
I've never had the chance to perform

702
35:27.740 --> 35:29.860
the lice-catching dance Mr. Xu taught me.

703
35:28.850 --> 35:32.080
[Dong Biwu, Party Secretary of the Cadre Rest and Recuperation Company]

704
35:30.050 --> 35:31.910
Today is such a good opportunity.

705
35:32.220 --> 35:33.900
How about I perform it for everyone?

706
35:33.900 --> 35:35.860
Great.

707
35:37.900 --> 35:41.170
Red Army soldiers are busy marching.

708
35:41.530 --> 35:45.150
Annoying lice are acting fierce.

709
35:45.170 --> 35:46.570
Great.

710
35:46.780 --> 35:49.680
Take off the fur coat and look carefully.

711
35:49.940 --> 35:51.560
[Zhong Chibing, Political Commissar of the 5th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

712
35:50.220 --> 35:52.940
Where are the greedy lice hiding?

713
35:53.380 --> 35:55.490
-Great! -Great!

714
35:54.820 --> 35:56.050
[Cai Chang, wife of Li Fuchun]

715
35:56.110 --> 35:57.170
[Qian Xijun, Mo Zemin's wife]

716
35:56.530 --> 35:57.570
-Great! -Great!

717
35:57.700 --> 36:00.380
Rouse your spirit and go to the battlefield.

718
36:00.610 --> 36:01.860
Great.

719
36:02.220 --> 36:03.820
Excuse my poor performance.

720
36:05.380 --> 36:08.570
♪ A gong in my left hand, a drum in my right ♪

721
36:09.170 --> 36:12.970
♪ I sing as I play, with all my might ♪

722
36:12.970 --> 36:16.650
♪ I don't know any other songs to sing ♪

723
36:16.720 --> 36:20.600
♪ Just the Fengyang song, that's my thing ♪

724
36:20.990 --> 36:24.680
♪ The Fengyang song ♪

725
36:24.990 --> 36:28.990
♪ A gong in my left hand, a drum in my right ♪

726
36:29.050 --> 36:32.610
♪ I sing as I play, with all my might ♪

727
36:32.930 --> 36:36.740
♪ I don't know any other songs to sing ♪

728
36:37.170 --> 36:40.860
♪ Just the Fengyang song, that's my thing ♪

729
36:41.130 --> 36:43.040
♪ The Fengyang song ♪

730
36:44.940 --> 36:45.930
♪ The Fengyang ♪

731
36:47.420 --> 36:48.420
Take cover quickly!

732
36:48.420 --> 36:49.080
Take cover quickly!

733
36:49.080 --> 36:50.370
Take cover quickly!

734
36:51.450 --> 36:52.580
Take cover quickly!

735
36:54.090 --> 36:55.220
Take cover quickly!

736
36:57.570 --> 36:58.570
Take cover quickly!

737
36:58.570 --> 37:01.450
Take cover quickly!

738
37:02.690 --> 37:03.290
Hurry!

739
37:03.570 --> 37:04.380
Hurry!

740
37:04.380 --> 37:04.940
Take cover!

741
37:04.940 --> 37:06.140
Get down! Take cover!

742
37:07.010 --> 37:07.820
Get down!

743
37:07.820 --> 37:08.700
Take cover!

744
37:09.610 --> 37:10.530
Leave me alone!

745
37:10.570 --> 37:11.490
Leave me alone!

746
37:12.170 --> 37:13.090
Go quickly!

747
37:35.780 --> 37:36.700
Get down!

748
38:32.490 --> 38:33.380
Given that

749
38:33.740 --> 38:35.340
Chiang Kai-shek has heavily deployed troops

750
38:35.340 --> 38:36.800
in Pingyi and the areas north of it,

751
38:36.800 --> 38:38.300
I agree with Comrade Zedong's proposal

752
38:38.300 --> 38:40.700
to abandon our original plan

753
38:40.730 --> 38:41.930
to advance on Pingyi.

754
38:42.050 --> 38:44.860
But at the same time, I hope our Military Commission

755
38:44.860 --> 38:47.660
can listen more to the opinions of the Corps below.

756
38:48.610 --> 38:51.260
Lin and Nie proposed to first occupy Dongchuan,

757
38:51.260 --> 38:53.050
cross the Jinsha River via Dongchuan,

758
38:53.050 --> 38:54.220
enter northwestern Sichuan,

759
38:54.220 --> 38:55.450
and join forces with the 4th Front Army.

760
38:55.450 --> 38:58.340
Peng and Yang proposed that the troops advance from the northwest,

761
38:58.340 --> 38:59.650
cross the Donghong River,

762
38:59.650 --> 39:00.910
and gain time for rest.

763
39:01.050 --> 39:03.170
If we follow Lin and Nie's idea

764
39:04.050 --> 39:05.510
and cross the Jinsha River

765
39:05.650 --> 39:06.730
via Dongchuan,

766
39:07.410 --> 39:09.340
the entire army could leave Yunnan

767
39:09.700 --> 39:11.010
in less than five days,

768
39:11.220 --> 39:14.820
and joining up with the 4th Front Army would soon be within reach.

769
39:22.010 --> 39:24.650
The opinions of the 1st and 3rd Corps were proposed

770
39:24.650 --> 39:27.130
considering the fact that the field army

771
39:27.260 --> 39:28.260
is currently too tired.

772
39:28.260 --> 39:30.590
They want to rest one more day if possible.

773
39:30.740 --> 39:32.820
Take the shorter bowstring route,

774
39:32.820 --> 39:35.050
not the longer route along the bow's curve.

775
39:35.050 --> 39:37.090
Mao, what's your opinion?

776
39:37.740 --> 39:40.380
Our ultimate goal is to cross the Jinsha River

777
39:40.700 --> 39:42.530
and join forces with the 4th Front Army.

778
39:42.530 --> 39:43.500
We know

779
39:43.650 --> 39:44.780
this objective,

780
39:45.530 --> 39:46.730
and so does the enemy.

781
39:46.970 --> 39:49.570
If we take this so-called bowstring route,

782
39:49.740 --> 39:51.450
it will definitely be expected by the enemy,

783
39:51.450 --> 39:53.900
and they will definitely deploy troops along the way.

784
39:53.900 --> 39:54.760
And currently,

785
39:55.100 --> 39:57.310
we are only three days ahead of them.

786
39:57.610 --> 39:58.740
Once we are delayed,

787
39:59.090 --> 40:01.020
the Kuomintang army will swarm up.

788
40:01.130 --> 40:02.710
The consequences would be unthinkable.

789
40:02.710 --> 40:03.970
But besides this plan,

790
40:04.340 --> 40:05.600
there is no better way.

791
40:05.780 --> 40:06.410
Yes.

792
40:10.010 --> 40:11.300
Report.

793
40:12.610 --> 40:13.450
Report.

794
40:14.300 --> 40:15.050
Chairman,

795
40:15.610 --> 40:18.610
Mrs. Mao was seriously injured in the enemy's bombing

796
40:18.690 --> 40:20.350
and is in critical condition.

797
40:22.740 --> 40:23.670
Comrade Zedong,

798
40:23.780 --> 40:24.740
go to the Recuperation Company quickly.

799
40:24.740 --> 40:26.040
Mao, ride a horse and go see her quickly.

800
40:26.040 --> 40:27.220
Comrade Zedong, go quickly.

801
40:27.220 --> 40:28.380
Go quickly, Mao.

802
40:28.570 --> 40:29.420
Mao, go quickly. We can discuss it here.

803
40:29.420 --> 40:29.970
Prepare a horse.

804
40:29.970 --> 40:30.780
Yes.

805
40:31.050 --> 40:32.800
Changfeng, prepare a horse.

806
40:33.260 --> 40:34.190
Prepare a horse!

807
40:34.850 --> 40:35.780
Prepare a horse.

808
40:39.850 --> 40:41.560
Mao, Chairman, go quickly.

809
40:41.580 --> 40:42.270
Go quickly.

810
40:42.300 --> 40:43.380
Comrade Zedong.

811
40:56.130 --> 40:56.900
Kunming.

812
40:56.960 --> 40:57.960
Kunming?

813
40:58.490 --> 41:00.570
Chairman, you mean

814
41:00.780 --> 41:03.380
another feint to the east while striking west?

815
41:03.380 --> 41:06.420
Both that and drawing the enemy away from its stronghold.

816
41:06.420 --> 41:08.940
First, order the 9th Red Army Corps by telegram

817
41:08.940 --> 41:10.540
to advance towards Xuanwei.

818
41:10.650 --> 41:13.430
At the same time, the main force of the Red Army will

819
41:13.430 --> 41:14.490
pass through Pingyi at the fastest speed,

820
41:14.490 --> 41:15.740
approach Kunming,

821
41:16.460 --> 41:18.780
and create the illusion of attacking Kunming.

822
41:18.780 --> 41:19.610
In this way,

823
41:19.890 --> 41:22.090
Long Yun will definitely protect himself,

824
41:22.090 --> 41:24.050
and Chiang Kai-shek will not give up

825
41:24.050 --> 41:26.340
the good opportunity to order the Central Army to enter Kunming.

826
41:26.340 --> 41:28.400
When they all press towards Kunming,

827
41:28.430 --> 41:29.880
we can calmly go north.

828
41:31.780 --> 41:34.040
We must first open up the strategic space

829
41:34.260 --> 41:36.590
to gain enough time to cross the river.

830
41:50.120 --> 41:51.320
Chairman, Chairman.

831
41:51.510 --> 41:52.550
Comrade Zedong.

832
42:45.810 --> 42:46.520
Mrs. Mao.

833
42:47.130 --> 42:48.530
Wake up, Sister-in-law.

834
42:48.610 --> 42:49.810
Has Brother arrived?

835
42:50.480 --> 42:51.410
Sister-in-law.

836
42:51.780 --> 42:53.940
Sister-in-law, don't fall asleep.

837
42:54.040 --> 42:56.480
Please don't fall asleep, Sister-in-law.

838
42:54.150 --> 42:55.760
[He Zizhen, Mao Zedong's wife]

839
42:55.760 --> 42:57.500
[Qian Xijun, Mao Zemin's wife]

840
42:56.920 --> 42:58.000
-Zizhen. -Sister-in-law.

841
42:58.000 --> 42:59.930
I've sent someone to call Brother.

842
42:59.970 --> 43:01.420
The Military Commission's headquarters is not far from here.

843
43:01.420 --> 43:03.460
Brother will come to see you soon, Sister-in-law.
